<p class="tt-kicker">PCM Training</p>
<h1 class="tt-title"><span class="tt-title-line">A shared language</span><span class="tt-title-line">for understanding</span><span class="tt-title-line">one another</span></h1>
<div class="tt-hero-meta">16 hours · ET · EN · RU · in Tallinn or on-site across Estonia</div>
<a class="tt-button" href="mailto:contact@tujutaju.ee?subject=PCM%20training%20dates">Ask for training dates</a>
</div>
